#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:389
msgid "Abandoned Cart Recovery"
msgstr "Recuperación de Carritos Abandonados"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:390
msgid ""
"Automatically recover lost sales with targeted emails to customers who left "
"items in their cart."
msgstr ""
"Recupera automáticamente ventas perdidas con correos dirigidos a clientes que "
"dejaron productos en su carrito."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:404
msgid "Transactional Emails"
msgstr "Correos Transaccionales"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:405
msgid ""
"Replace default WooCommerce emails with beautiful MandrakeCRM templates: New "
"Account, Processing, On Hold, Completed, Customer Note, Refunded, Cancelled, "
"Failed, and Password Reset."
msgstr ""
"Reemplaza los correos predeterminados de WooCommerce con hermosas plantillas de "
"MandrakeCRM: Nueva Cuenta, Procesando, En Espera, Completado, Nota al Cliente, "
"Reembolsado, Cancelado, Fallido y Restablecer Contraseña."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:420
msgid "Smart Lead Capture Widgets"
msgstr "Widgets Inteligentes de Captura de Leads"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:421
msgid ""
"Convert visitors into customers with smart widgets: lead capture popups, "
"WhatsApp buttons, and more."
msgstr ""
"Convierte visitantes en clientes con widgets inteligentes: popups de captura "
"de leads, botones de WhatsApp y mas."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:436
msgid "Checkout Marketing Consent"
msgstr "Consentimiento de Marketing en el Checkout"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:437
msgid ""
"Grow your subscriber list by collecting marketing consent during checkout."
msgstr ""
"Haz crecer tu lista de suscriptores recopilando consentimiento de marketing "
"durante el checkout."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:439
#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:447
