msgstr "Siempre Activo"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:444
msgid "Marketing Attribution Tracking"
msgstr "Seguimiento de Atribución de Marketing"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:445
msgid ""
"Track UTM parameters to measure campaign ROI and attribute sales to your "
"MandrakeCRM campaigns."
msgstr ""
"Rastrea parámetros UTM para medir el ROI de campañas y atribuir ventas a tus "
"campañas de MandrakeCRM."

