msgid "You'll stop capturing new leads and potential customers"
msgstr "Dejarás de capturar nuevos leads y clientes potenciales"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:523
msgid "You'll lose visibility into what's actually working to drive sales"
msgstr "Perderás visibilidad de lo que realmente está funcionando para impulsar ventas"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:528
